"""
Taming Trainer - Legion Scripting conversion

Original Author: Aga (uosteam script)
Converted to Razor Enhanced by: TheWarDoctor95 - March 19, 2019
Converted to Legion Scripting (TazUO) API by: Claude

Description:
    Tames nearby animals to train Taming to GM.

Notes on the conversion:
    - The original relied on Razor Enhanced's `Scripts.glossary.tameables` module to
      look up which body graphics were tameable and their taming difficulty. Legion has
      no equivalent, so a curated TAMEABLES table (body graphic -> difficulty) is embedded
      below. See problems.md for details.
    - Following/tracking the animal now uses Legion's built in pathfinding instead of the
      manual tile-by-tile walking in the original.
    - Razor's Timer.Create / Timer.Check helpers are re-implemented in pure Python.
"""

import API
import time
import System
from System import UInt16

## Script options ##
